OL,3,AAnthropic flags revenue surge to
OL,4,Ainvestors ahead of stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtificial intelligence (AI) giant
OL,7,FAnthropic saw its revenue surge by 45%
OL,8,Fto $16.8bn (#12.7bn) in the three
OL,9,Fmonths to the end of September, the BBC
OL,10,Funderstands.
OL,12,FThe figures were revealed by the
OL,13,FClaude-developer as it briefed
OL,14,Fprospective investors on Wednesday at
OL,15,Fits headquarters in San Francisco as it
OL,16,Flays the groundwork for a stock market
OL,17,Flisting, which is expected to take
OL,18,Fplace before the end of the year.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
